   "title": ".Notes",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "TT SDXL image-to-image for Photoshop (SD-PPP 2.0).\n\nPanel shows: 00 Image (set it from the canvas or a layer), 01 Prompt, 02 Negative prompt, 03 Sampler. Nodes titled with a leading '.' are hidden from the panel.\n\nThe image is stretched to 1024x1024 for the TT model, then the result is scaled back to the original canvas size so it lines up when you Send to PS as a layer. Very wide or tall canvases distort more; crop near-square for best results.\n\nSampler denoise is the strength: 0.8-0.85 (cfg 8-9) for photo -> cartoon, ~0.6 (cfg 7) for light restyles, 0.9+ drifts from the original. Runs int(steps x denoise) steps. No masks / inpainting yet. No unload node here: use tt_shutdown_reset when done."
   ]
  }
 ],
